 "name_en": "Corrective Maintenance (BH1)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Corrective Maintenance (BH1)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio9dd924ce62194b19bbfba4ce163e39a8\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio9dd924ce62194b19bbfba4ce163e39a8__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item allows you to perform the corrective maintenance of technical objects whenever a breakdown or failure occurs. The plant maintenance component provides a comprehensive notification and order system to facilitate this process. You process a repair using several planning stages such as preliminary costing, work scheduling, material provision, and resource planning. You also react immediately to issues that may lead to the shutdown of production facilities. When this becomes necessary, you can create the required maintenance orders and shop papers with minimum entries in the shortest possible time.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio9dd924ce62194b19bbfba4ce163e39a8__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create malfunction report</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create maintenance order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Release maintenance order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Print job card</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Confirm maintenance order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Show costs on maintenance order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Technically complete maintenance order</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio9dd924ce62194b19bbfba4ce163e39a8__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Support processing of maintenance operations with internal resources</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Increase transparency of costs and time spent on individual assets for maintenance purposes</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Simplify actual order cost tracking and assignment of costs to settlement receiver for greater transparency and cost controlling</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Enable recording of working hours on the cost objects for effort-tracking</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Plan stock materials, non-stock materials, and services for repair</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>纠正维护 (BH1)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio9dd924ce62194b19bbfba4ce163e39a8\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio9dd924ce62194b19bbfba4ce163e39a8__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目允许您在发生故障或崩溃时，对技术对象执行纠正维护。工厂维护组件提供了全面的通知和订单系统来简化此流程。您可以使用多个计划阶段（如初始成本核算、工作计划、物料供应和资源计划）处理维修。您还可以立即对可能导致生产设施关闭的问题做出反应。当有必要时，您可以在最短的可能时间内创建具有最小条目的所需维护订单和车间加工单。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio9dd924ce62194b19bbfba4ce163e39a8__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建故障报告</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建维护订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">下达维护订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">打印作业卡</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">确认维护订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">显示维护订单的成本</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">技术上完成维护订单</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio9dd924ce62194b19bbfba4ce163e39a8__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">支持使用内部资源处理维护操作</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提高出于维护目的花费在各项资产上的成本和时间的透明度。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">简化实际订单成本跟踪，并将成本分配给结算接收方，从而提高透明度和成本控制能力</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在成本对象上启用工作时间记录，以进行工作量跟踪</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">计划库存物料、非库存物料和维修服务</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
